      "text": "Subject: Drawing, Speech Competitions and “Meri Seva, Mera Sankalp” – Student Reel Making Competition under “Sena Sankalp Abhiyan” from 17.09.2026 to 17.10.2026 in Government Schools of NCT of Delhi."
