        252.6,
        503.37,
        340.17,
        89.25,
        340.17
      ],
      "text": "The Directorate of Education, Government of NCT of Delhi, is pleased to announce the organisation of various student-centric activities under “Sewa Sankalp Abhiyan”, with the objective of providing students an opportunity to express their ideas, creativity and aspirations relating to public service, development, nation-building and the vision of “Vikst Bharat @2047”. The Abhiyan seeks to highlight the journey of public service over the past 25 years and create awareness among students regarding various welfare and development initiatives."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        89.25,
        346.9,
        503.37,
        346.9,
        503.37,
        377.22,
        89.25,
        377.22
      ],
      "text": "Accordingly, all Heads of Government Schools of NCT of Delhi are directed to ensure active participation of students in the following competitions:"
